# User Data Guidelines

This service is currently being bootstrapped.

## Patterns to Mimic

- Use `apps/auth-service` and `apps/product-service` as the "Gold Standard" for structure.
- Use `packages/nestjs-common` for shared NestJS components when possible.
- Look at `apps/auth-service/src/common` and `apps/product-service/src/common` for Exception Filters, Interceptors, and Decorators that should be ported or shared.
- Unlike the other two services, User Data Service uses Mongoose with MongoDB.
